      "value": "To also add a use-case why a fix would have some importance to me:\n\nI made a few custom mirrors with some unique effects. Unfortunately, with the wrong FOV, I can't get the mirror image to align correctly on the photo camera. There are also a few other things like portals that would suffer from the same issue.",
